WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Standing LP deliberately misses the knocked-down Ryu.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Held back HP hits Ryu on wake-up.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.000
Back HP continues into heavy Dimachaerus.

4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.900
The forward-punch follow-up maintains the juggle.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.550
Held back HP picks up the airborne Ryu.

6
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.400
Light Phalanx completes the performed ending.
